# This repository is public and lives at ~/.claude/skills, where any user-level
# skill also lands. So the default is exclude-everything: a file joins the public
# engine deliberately, never by being in the directory.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE

!lifecycle/
!lifecycle/LIFECYCLE.md
!lifecycle/contexts.example/
!lifecycle/contexts.example/*.md

!plan-loop/
!plan-loop/SKILL.md
!build/
!build/SKILL.md
!verify/
!verify/SKILL.md
!retro/
!retro/SKILL.md

# Private by construction. Real adapters carry internal hostnames, tracker ids,
# and product facts; run logs carry whatever a run touched. Neither is engine.
lifecycle/contexts/
lifecycle/logs/
